  introDialogue: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7e1f790693c494d449c01897a975fc1a, type: 2}
  questionResponses:
  - question: Where are you coming from?
    answer: The salon on Rustaveli. Two perms, a color, and my own jaw.
    mismatchAnswer: My salon on Plekhanov Avenue. The light is good for color.
    uncannyAnswer: The supply depot. Do not ask what I bought.
    cameraTrigger: 
  - question: Are you experiencing any symptoms?
    answer: Jaw bruising. Self-administered filler. It settles by Sunday.
    mismatchAnswer: Nothing. I have never had a procedure. All natural.
    uncannyAnswer: No symptoms. These are improvements. There is a difference.
    cameraTrigger: 
  idleBarks:
  - Your skin is dehydrated, Officer. Drink water. Use SPF. I beg you.
  - I opened the salon at six. I will close it when the city does.
  uncannyIdleBarks:
  - Stop looking at my face. I can see you looking.
